;; What this case exercises; edit by hand.  `bb corpus-accept' leaves it alone.
(:book "A new reference grammar of modern Spanish (2019)"
 :source "Espanol/A new reference grammar of modern Spanish (2019).pdf"
 :page 22
 :exercises "Parallel vertical flows, the FW11 fix landed.  The gender lists set
their items in three lanes; the multicolumn pass reads each lane to
its end - one item per line, continuations indented under their item
- where the zone repair used to braid the lanes by baseline into
pseudo-prose.  The page's real prose - the fruit and nut paragraphs
above the list - keeps flowing.  The dropped line is the
folio-merged running head.  The budget is the item lines themselves:
an entry ending lowercase over the next entry opening lowercase is
what the mid-sentence measure reads as a break, the listings class."
 :budget (:mid-sentence 19))
